  "description": "ASP.NET Core middleware pipeline that adds RSA + AES-256-GCM body encryption,\n      HMAC-SHA256 request signing, timestamp validation, and nonce-based anti-replay\n      protection to any POST / PUT / PATCH endpoint. Zero static secrets —\n      all keys are generated per-request and exchanged via RSA. Pluggable key storage\n      supports Azure Key Vault, AWS KMS, Google Cloud Secret Manager, HashiCorp Vault,\n      or any custom IRsaKeyStorageProvider implementation.",
